=== Basic Single Inheritance ===

=== Creating Instances ===
Animal speak: Generic Animal makes a sound
Animal describe: Animal: Generic Animal

Dog speak: Buddy barks
Dog describe: Animal: Buddy (Breed: Labrador)

=== Checking Inheritance ===
Dog is kind of Animal: true
Dog is kind of Object: true
Animal is kind of Dog: false

=== Inheritance Chain ===

Cat name: Whiskers
Cat color: orange
Cat speaks: Meow!
Cat describes: Animal: Whiskers (Color: orange)

=== Method Lookup ===
Methods are found by searching up the inheritance chain.
Use 'super' to call the parent class implementation.
